{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35734472",
      "title": "What Is React & Why Would You Use It?",
      "sourceHash": "136610a17e6b897e41994d3067926dbcf380ef1b302c860610c33ecd8c0ae177",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 4.56,
          "en": "Now to get started, let's start by diving",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.56,
          "end": 7.11,
          "en": "into the most important question first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.11,
          "end": 11.01,
          "en": "What exactly is React.js?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.01,
          "end": 13.62,
          "en": "Well, the official website tells us,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.62,
          "end": 18.62,
          "en": "React is a JavaScript library for building user interfaces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.44,
          "end": 22.59,
          "en": "And that's a nice sentence, but what exactly does it mean?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.59,
          "end": 25.47,
          "en": "Well, obviously it's a JavaScript library",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.47,
          "end": 27.69,
          "en": "so we will write JavaScript code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.69,
          "end": 32.04,
          "en": "We use React in conjunction with our own JavaScript code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.04,
          "end": 33.57,
          "en": "but it is a library that's there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.57,
          "end": 36.72,
          "en": "to help us build user interfaces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.72,
          "end": 39.33,
          "en": "And I might add that it's there to help us build",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.33,
          "end": 42.45,
          "en": "highly interactive user interfaces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.45,
          "end": 44.58,
          "en": "You don't necessarily need React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.58,
          "end": 46.8,
          "en": "if you build a simple webpage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.8,
          "end": 49.89,
          "en": "on which not a lot of things are happening.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.89,
          "end": 52.53,
          "en": "But if you're building a more interactive website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.53,
          "end": 55.23,
          "en": "like the demo project we're about to build,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.23,
          "end": 58.44,
          "en": "then React.js can be a huge help",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.44,
          "end": 62.46,
          "en": "vastly simplifying the code you have to write.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.46,
          "end": 63.81,
          "en": "And to show you what I mean,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.81,
          "end": 67.14,
          "en": "consider this very simple example here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.14,
          "end": 70.92,
          "en": "I get this user card where I have this Contact button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.92,
          "end": 74.73,
          "en": "And if I click this button, this modal overlay opens up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.73,
          "end": 78.06,
          "en": "and there I can enter some address and submit it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.06,
          "end": 79.8,
          "en": "Now, this is not super fancy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.8,
          "end": 83.46000000000001,
          "en": "but we have a website with some interaction on it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.46000000000001,
          "end": 86.64,
          "en": "We have a website where I can open this modal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.64,
          "end": 89.03999999999999,
          "en": "and enter data and submit it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.03999999999999,
          "end": 90.57,
          "en": "Now on this demo website,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.57,
          "end": 93.27000000000001,
          "en": "nothing's happening to that submitted data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.27000000000001,
          "end": 95.88,
          "en": "But we do have a website that does support",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.88,
          "end": 99.09,
          "en": "some user interaction that must be interactive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.09,
          "end": 103.05,
          "en": "and reactive because we must React to button clicks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.05,
          "end": 104.88,
          "en": "and openness overlay.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.88,
          "end": 108.33,
          "en": "And even though that's a pretty simple example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.33,
          "end": 110.19,
          "en": "and a simple website here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.19,
          "end": 111.6,
          "en": "The JavaScript code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 111.6,
          "end": 115.28999999999999,
          "en": "we could write to make this website work this way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 115.28999999999999,
          "end": 117.75,
          "en": "and to make the website behave that way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 117.75,
          "end": 122.75,
          "en": "when not using React.js could look like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 123.03,
          "end": 125.88,
          "en": "And whilst this is of course not too much code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 125.88,
          "end": 130.65,
          "en": "it's quite a bit of code for this simple interaction.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 130.65,
          "end": 133.02,
          "en": "And it's probably easy to imagine",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 133.02,
          "end": 135.78,
          "en": "that if we had a more complex website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 135.78,
          "end": 138.96,
          "en": "with more user interactions on it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 138.96,
          "end": 141.78,
          "en": "we would need to write a lot more code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 141.78,
          "end": 144.72,
          "en": "And of course, therefore we would introduce",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 144.72,
          "end": 148.74,
          "en": "more potential error sources.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 148.74,
          "end": 153.74,
          "en": "Now, when building the exact same application with React.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 154.89,
          "end": 159.89,
          "en": "the code suddenly looks like this combined with this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.11,
          "end": 163.82999999999998,
          "en": "And whilst this is still some code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 163.82999999999998,
          "end": 167.19,
          "en": "it's a bit more readable and easier to manage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 167.19,
          "end": 169.98,
          "en": "And as soon as you know React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.98,
          "end": 172.11,
          "en": "which you will do by the end of the video,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 172.11,
          "end": 176.01,
          "en": "it's also much easier to read as you will see.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.01,
          "end": 179.64,
          "en": "Because even though you don't know React yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 179.64,
          "end": 181.17,
          "en": "you can clearly see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 181.17,
          "end": 184.14,
          "en": "that we seem to be writing some JavaScript code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 184.14,
          "end": 186.72,
          "en": "where we have some HTML code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 186.72,
          "end": 189.9,
          "en": "blended into that JavaScript code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 189.9,
          "end": 193.77,
          "en": "And we then have clear instructions like setShowModal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 193.77,
          "end": 195.93,
          "en": "which seems to do something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 195.93,
          "end": 198.99,
          "en": "which then leads to that Modal being shown conditionally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 198.99,
          "end": 201.87,
          "en": "And again, I will teach you all that code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 201.87,
          "end": 205.05,
          "en": "and React syntax and all these React features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 205.05,
          "end": 207.78,
          "en": "step by step throughout this video.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 207.78,
          "end": 209.88,
          "en": "You don't need to understand them yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 209.88,
          "end": 211.77,
          "en": "but you can probably see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 211.77,
          "end": 214.05,
          "en": "that we have some clear instructions here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 214.05,
          "end": 216.87,
          "en": "and some clean code, and most importantly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 216.87,
          "end": 220.98,
          "en": "some HTML code blended into the JavaScript code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 220.98,
          "end": 224.31,
          "en": "which is a feature that's supported by React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 224.31,
          "end": 227.43,
          "en": "and by the React projects we'll be working in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 227.43,
          "end": 230.13,
          "en": "as you will also learn in this video.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 230.13,
          "end": 233.67000000000002,
          "en": "In case of the raw Vanilla JavaScript code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 233.67000000000002,
          "end": 236.88,
          "en": "we just had step by step instructions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 236.88,
          "end": 240,
          "en": "where we tell the browser step by step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 240,
          "end": 241.92,
          "en": "what should happen on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 241.92,
          "end": 244.05,
          "en": "that we want to add an event listener,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 244.05,
          "end": 248.01,
          "en": "that we wanna create a new HTML element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 248.01,
          "end": 249.72,
          "en": "how it should be configured,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 249.72,
          "end": 252.33,
          "en": "where it should be added, and much more.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 252.33,
          "end": 254.22,
          "en": "We have step by step instructions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 254.22,
          "end": 257.82,
          "en": "And indeed we call this approach of writing code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 257.82,
          "end": 260.28,
          "en": "the imperative approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 260.28,
          "end": 262.77,
          "en": "where we have step by step instructions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 262.77,
          "end": 267.45,
          "en": "simply describing step by step what the browser should do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 267.45,
          "end": 270.39,
          "en": "On the other hand, when using React.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 270.39,
          "end": 272.64,
          "en": "a major benefit of doing so is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 272.64,
          "end": 275.43,
          "en": "that we're able to write declarative code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 275.43,
          "end": 277.89,
          "en": "where we write the code for the UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 277.89,
          "end": 279.69,
          "en": "that should be output on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 279.69,
          "end": 282.9,
          "en": "and we blend some syntax like event listeners",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 282.9,
          "end": 286.26,
          "en": "or dynamic values into that HTML code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 286.26,
          "end": 289.47,
          "en": "and combine it with extra React features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 289.47,
          "end": 292.92,
          "en": "where we can, for example, define different states",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 292.92,
          "end": 295.86,
          "en": "and under which circumstances these different states",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 295.86,
          "end": 296.90999999999997,
          "en": "should be active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 296.90999999999997,
          "end": 300.99,
          "en": "And React.js will then generate the appropriate instructions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 300.99,
          "end": 303.12,
          "en": "for the browser under the hood",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 303.12,
          "end": 304.68,
          "en": "so that as a developer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 304.68,
          "end": 308.79,
          "en": "we don't have to write these step by step instructions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 308.79,
          "end": 311.64,
          "en": "And that is indeed one of the major benefits",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 311.64,
          "end": 314.88,
          "en": "highlighted on the React.js website as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 314.88,
          "end": 317.31,
          "en": "the fact that you write the declarative code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 317.31,
          "end": 319.533,
          "en": "when working with React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 320.4,
          "end": 322.8,
          "en": "Now again, this is just a simple example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 322.8,
          "end": 324.78,
          "en": "with a lot of code we don't know yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 324.78,
          "end": 328.05,
          "en": "but that's one of the major advantages of using React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 328.05,
          "end": 331.35,
          "en": "We often can write much simpler code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 331.35,
          "end": 333.03,
          "en": "and therefore actually build",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 333.03,
          "end": 335.613,
          "en": "way more powerful user interfaces.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}